WEBVTT

00:02:58.132 --> 00:03:00.301
(Applause)

00:03:00.343 --> 00:03:03.346
Because in the United States,

00:03:03.387 --> 00:03:06.474
we have one of the highest rates
of infant mortality

00:03:06.515 --> 00:03:08.643
in the developed world.

00:03:08.643 --> 00:03:12.813
They also should be supporting programs
for children once they are born.

00:03:12.855 --> 00:03:16.442
(Applause)

00:03:16.484 --> 00:03:19.028
You know, what about the protection
of women's health?

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:23.407
Well, the reality is, abortion is already
an extremely safe surgical procedure.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.577
It is safer than childbirth.

00:03:27.995 --> 00:03:32.875
And imposing new restrictions on abortion
only makes it less safe.